      <h2 id="preparing-to-install-on-nutanix-agent-based-installer-reference_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="group scroll-mt-20">Agent-based Installer<a href="#preparing-to-install-on-nutanix-agent-based-installer-reference_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>You can install an OpenShift Container Platform cluster on Nutanix by using the Agent-based Installer. The Agent-based Installer can be used to install a three-node cluster, which is a smaller, more resource efficient cluster for testing, development, and production.</p>
