      <h2 id="installation-nutanix-installer-infra-reqs_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="group scroll-mt-20">Environment requirements<a href="#installation-nutanix-installer-infra-reqs_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Before you install an OpenShift Container Platform cluster, verify that your infrastructure, account privileges, and network configuration meet the Nutanix AOS environment requirements needed for a successful installation.</p>
      <h3 id="installation-nutanix-installer-infrastructure-reqs_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="group scroll-mt-20">Infrastructure requirements<a href="#installation-nutanix-installer-infrastructure-reqs_preparing-to-install-on-nutanix" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>You can install OpenShift Container Platform on on-premise Nutanix clusters, Nutanix Cloud Clusters (NC2) on Amazon Web Services (AWS), or NC2 on Microsoft Azure.</p>
